Send a second Hbindname for the already-bound command tag. whichtextOrNil finds
the existing text, so the handler takes its "let the old one win, clean up the
new" path instead of binding a fresh text.

-- input --
growdata 0 0 hi\n
bindname 0 0
-- waitframes --
28 31 31
-- drawops --
JIqbbAbddbbbbdbbbbdbbbYbilbbd{5}bbd{28}llddxdd
